derstorm Warning for...\nCentral Presidio County in southwestern Texas...\n\n* Until 500 PM CDT.\n\n* At 431 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located over Adobes, or 15\nmiles northwest of Presidio, and is nearly stationary.\n\nHAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and quarter size hail.\n\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\n\nIMPACT...Hail damage to vehicles is expected. Expect wind damage\nto roofs, siding, and trees.\n\n* Locations impacted include...\nAdobes and Chinati Mountains.","instruction":"For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a\nbuilding.","response":"Shelter","note":null,"parameters":{"AWIPSidentifier":["SVRMAF"],"WMOidentifier":["WUUS54 KMAF 082131"],"eventMotionDescription":["2026-09-08T21:31:00-00:00...storm...040DEG...4KT...29.76,-104.51"],"windThreat":["RADAR INDICATED"],"maxWindGust":["60 MPH"],"hailThreat":["RADAR INDICATED"],"maxHailSize":["1.00"],"BLOCKCHANNEL":["EAS","NWEM","CMAS"],"EAS-ORG":["WXR"],"VTEC":["/O.NEW.KMAF.SV.W.0238.260908T2131Z-260908T2200Z/"],"eventEndingTime":["2026-09-08T17:00:00-05:00"]},"scope":"Public","code":"IPAWSv1.0","language":"en-US","web":"http://www.weather.gov","eventCode":{"SAME":["SVR"],"NationalWeatherService":["SVW"]}}}]}